+PyTorch v2.10.0 aten/src/ATen/native/cpu/FlashAttentionKernel.cpp and
+aten/src/ATen/cpu/vec/vec256/vec256_float.h (CPU exp_u20), plus native
+Welford/normalization/cascade reduction arithmetic. PyTorch BSD-3-Clause:
